  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(ASAP!) Phase II - Accelerating and Strengthening the Action of UU TPKS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s expected effect(s) on society is imroved access to justice for victims of gender-based violence (and their families) in Indonesia after the enactment of the UU TPKS (the Law on Sexual Violence Crimes). The expected effects for the target groups are a) drafted regulations of UU TPKS (presidential regulations, presidential decrees, and ministerial regulations), b) strengthened capacity of relevant law enforcers and paralegals in handling the anti-sexual violence cases with victim-rights perspectives and approaches, c) increased public awareness on the implementation, practicality, and impact of UU TPKS.</narrative>
  </description>
